Installing Maven
cd opt/
sudo wget https://dlcdn.apache.org/maven/maven-3/3.9.16/binaries/apache-maven-3.9.16-bin.tar.gz

sudo tar -xzf apache-maven-3.9.16-bin.tar.gz

Verify:

ls -l /opt

You should see:

apache-maven-3.9.16
Step 2: Rename the Directory
sudo mv apache-maven-3.9.16 maven

Now Maven will be installed in:

/opt/maven

Step 3: Configure Environment Variables

Create a profile file:

sudo nano /etc/profile.d/maven.sh

Paste the following:

export JAVA_HOME=$(dirname $(dirname $(readlink -f $(which java))))
export M2_HOME=/opt/maven
export MAVEN_HOME=/opt/maven
export PATH=$PATH:$M2_HOME/bin

Save:

Step 4: Load the Environment Variables
source /etc/profile.d/maven.sh

Also add it to your shell so it's available after login:

echo "source /etc/profile.d/maven.sh" >> ~/.bashrc
source ~/.bashrc
Step 5: Verify the Installation
mvn -version

You should get output similar to:

Apache Maven 3.9.16
Maven home: /opt/maven
Java version: 21.0.11
Java home: /usr/lib/jvm/...
OS: Linux
Step 6: Verify Environment Variables
echo $JAVA_HOME
echo $M2_HOME
which mvn

Expected:

/opt/maven/bin/mvn
Since you're using Jenkins, do one more thing

Make Maven available to the Jenkins service.

Edit the Jenkins environment file:

sudo nano /etc/default/jenkins

If the file exists, add:

JAVA_HOME=/usr/lib/jvm/java-21-openjdk-amd64
M2_HOME=/opt/maven
MAVEN_HOME=/opt/maven
PATH=/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin:/opt/maven/bin

Then restart Jenkins:

sudo systemctl restart jenkins

Create the kubeconfig for Jenkins

Run these commands exactly:

sudo mkdir -p /var/lib/jenkins/.kube

sudo cp /etc/kubernetes/admin.conf /var/lib/jenkins/.kube/config

sudo chown -R jenkins:jenkins /var/lib/jenkins/.kube

sudo chmod 600 /var/lib/jenkins/.kube/config

Verify the file exists:

sudo ls -l /var/lib/jenkins/.kube

Expected:

config
Fix 2: Test as the Jenkins user

Run:

sudo -u jenkins kubectl get nodes

You should get something like:

NAME         STATUS   ROLES
k8s-master   Ready    control-plane
worker1      Ready
worker2      Ready
